{"v":4,"catch":"秘密と謎に満ちた物語を紐解け。","desc":"Iris Fallは光と影を操るゲームです。ゲーム中の物語・絵・パズルのデザインは、すべて光と影の概念がベースになっています。光と影の間を行き来しながら、黒と白が織りなす独特な世界を2Dと3Dで体験して、ふたつの現実を通り抜けましょう。","publisher":"PM Studios","release":"2021-02-18","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語","英語","スペイン語","フランス語","ドイツ語","イタリア語","ポルトガル語","ロシア語","韓国語","中国語 (簡体字)","中国語 (繁体字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"A","size":"Switch 2 2.4GB / Switch 2.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36c3d524fd8d2601e8c6b2bb55b8629bf0463776cb0be4d8d90b5f6b81ce359f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/449165c632ba59e6384a80087850b388899edbe87e86f112e569c98c37e7c18e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f061a5a3a36b4afe676abc87de400fbe5dbaf4b84ba54121dc6207c8157ea99.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cbc3a9e6b1735629ddaae6be838a6e0a6efa3cda27520b3a2843f1c134e8ab68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8aa9de0108c6fd8fd4441ed9643f1845b957f540d9b63ff0b4b47168aa4041bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54d70fd45a7a7fa76d7bbefa9eb1180dd144ae574e9f65a7db58e5003e79cd91.jpg"],"titleId":"0100945012168000"}